        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela ambebo, nubakwesu, kuciindi eco ncindakasika kulindinywe, teensi cabwaambe bwiinda na cabusongo bwiinda ncindakasika kuzoo­ mukambaukila makani aa-Leza, pe. ",
